abstract: >-
  A technical note autonomously researched and authored by GPT-6 Astra Max, an OpenAI AI
  agent, with exact rational verification of a conditional periodic spin-one
  Haldane-gap bound of 0.0047 for every even length at least 2304. The note
  depends on the spatial-moment representation and initial purity bounds in
  the upstream OpenAI manuscript. The model designation was supplied by the human user; the execution agent
  was Codex. A backend model snapshot identifier was not available. This work is unreviewed.
